    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 A massive world where madness meets romance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c 1000+ jaw-dropping artworks &amp; scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad 20+ main characters !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 30+ hours of story in the full release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae FREE DEMO: 2-3hr standalone story that\u2019ll blow your socks off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Welcome to CELL</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to CELL \u2014 a living city that grows, breathes, and whispers your darkest cravings into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/0881d7066b319049c80c042077e58a03.avif?t=1754237326\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every soul that steps inside is gifted with powers... and equally unexpected <i>curses</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t panic! We\u2019ve got a 360\u00b0 security system to keep the chaos <i>just tolerable enough</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CELL, your daily life includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/32bfd0e46258d667c34df1595f3771d8.poster.avif?t=1754237326\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/32bfd0e46258d667c34df1595f3771d8.webm?t=1754237326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what\u2019s the price of paradise? Go ahead, take a wild guess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Cheractor</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/6dd3df417c37db10f12af7079b00d898.poster.avif?t=1754237326\" width=616 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/6dd3df417c37db10f12af7079b00d898.webm?t=1754237326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/6dd3df417c37db10f12af7079b00d898.mp4?t=1754237326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She just arrived in CELL\u2026 and the city instantly labeled her a monster. Now she runs for her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl, who belongs to the brutal peacekeeping patrol of CELL, refuse her duty and lock herself in robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city where cutting in line means death by law, one woman persists in pursuing judicial justice with an idealistic fervor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, how will your paths cross? Will you fight, flirt, or flee? Or all of the above?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>From the Devs</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a narrative-driven game studio, creators of the indie game <i>GhostFeed</i>. Inspired by epic stories like <i>Fate/stay night</i> and <i>Steins;Gate</i>, and deeply moved by <i>EVA</i>'s visual storytelling, we craft immersive worlds in this spirit. This project was developed using the Wansei Xingchen Editor, boosting our workflow efficiency. We hope you enjoy this new chapter.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 A massive world where madness meets romance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c 1000+ jaw-dropping artworks &amp; scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad 20+ main characters !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 30+ hours of story in the full release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae FREE DEMO: 2-3hr standalone story that\u2019ll blow your socks off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Welcome to CELL</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to CELL \u2014 a living city that grows, breathes, and whispers your darkest cravings into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/0881d7066b319049c80c042077e58a03.avif?t=1754237326\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every soul that steps inside is gifted with powers... and equally unexpected <i>curses</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t panic! We\u2019ve got a 360\u00b0 security system to keep the chaos <i>just tolerable enough</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CELL, your daily life includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/32bfd0e46258d667c34df1595f3771d8.poster.avif?t=1754237326\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/32bfd0e46258d667c34df1595f3771d8.webm?t=1754237326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what\u2019s the price of paradise? Go ahead, take a wild guess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Cheractor</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/6dd3df417c37db10f12af7079b00d898.poster.avif?t=1754237326\" width=616 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/6dd3df417c37db10f12af7079b00d898.webm?t=1754237326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668550/extras/6dd3df417c37db10f12af7079b00d898.mp4?t=1754237326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She just arrived in CELL\u2026 and the city instantly labeled her a monster. Now she runs for her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl, who belongs to the brutal peacekeeping patrol of CELL, refuse her duty and lock herself in robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city where cutting in line means death by law, one woman persists in pursuing judicial justice with an idealistic fervor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, how will your paths cross? Will you fight, flirt, or flee? Or all of the above?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>From the Devs</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a narrative-driven game studio, creators of the indie game <i>GhostFeed</i>. Inspired by epic stories like <i>Fate/stay night</i> and <i>Steins;Gate</i>, and deeply moved by <i>EVA</i>'s visual storytelling, we craft immersive worlds in this spirit. This project was developed using the Wansei Xingchen Editor, boosting our workflow efficiency. We hope you enjoy this new chapter.</p>",
